{07 14 00}The sea air in the morning{01 00 00 05 00}
sure feels nice, doesn't it,
{01 00 00 0a 00}{04 02 00}?
{07 00 00}There's no fear of tanning
in this sun,{01 00 00 0a 00} {07 19 00}so gather as
many shells as you please.{07 00 00}

